'''"Hunter" Tobias''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}. They introduce the player to the [[Critterdex]].

== Interface ==
{{:Critterdex/UI}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!Dialogue
