&e[NPC] &6"Hunter" Tobias&f: &fI'm actually so great that I've caught every single &a Critter&f in the &2Critter Safari&f.
&e[NPC] &6"Hunter" Tobias&f: &f...And, before you ask, my success has nothing to do with the fact that my dad owns the place.
